# Code of Conduct

## Our Pledge
We are committed to providing a friendly, safe, and welcoming environment for everyone.

## Our Standards
Examples of positive behavior include respect, kindness, constructive feedback, and accepting responsibility for mistakes.

Unacceptable behavior includes harassment, insults, discrimination, and personal attacks.

## Enforcement Responsibilities
Project maintainers are responsible for clarifying and enforcing these standards.

## Scope
This Code of Conduct applies to all project spaces and public interactions related to the project.

## Enforcement
Unacceptable behavior may be reported to the project maintainers. Reports will be reviewed fairly and confidentially.

## Enforcement Guidelines
Maintainers may issue warnings, temporary restrictions, or permanent bans depending on the severity of the behavior.

## Attribution
This Code of Conduct is inspired by the Contributor Covenant.
